isplaying the warning message, if a memory card is inserted, auto save \(warning screen )Tj0 -1.2 TD(sequence\) should be restarted.)Tj0 -1.8 TD-0.018 Tw(When a warning message is displayed once, it is not necessary to display the message again unless power )Tj0 -1.2 TD0 Tw(to the main unit is turned off, except in cases when the memory card is inserted as mentioned above.)Tj/F18 1 Tf0 -2.7 TD(Required)Tj/F11 1 Tf0 -1.8 TD-0.018 Tw(If the save location of high scores and con\336guration data is assigned to Port )Tj/F19 1 Tf32.6309 0 TD0 Tw(A)Tj/F11 1 Tf0.7219 0 TD-0.018 Tw[( extension socket 1 accord-)]TJ-33.3528 -1.2 TD0 Tw(ing to 15.2.3, the port and expansion socket should be indicated in the caution message, such as \322A )TjT*-0.027 Tw(memory card is not inserted in Port )Tj/F19 1 Tf15.3611 0 TD0 Tw(A)Tj/F11 1 Tf0.7219 0 TD-0.027 Tw[( Extension Socket 1. Please insert a memory card at this location to )]TJ-16.083 -1.2 TD0 Tw(save High Score.\323 )TjETendstreamendobj943 0 obj<< /ProcSet [ /PDF /Text ] /Font << /F1 619 0 R /F11 441 0 R /F18 731 0 R /F19 728 0 R >> /ExtGState << /GS3 616 0 R >> >> endobj944 0 obj<< /Type /Page /Parent 974 0 R /Resources 946 0 R /Contents 945 0 R /CropBox [ 36 72 576 720 ] /B [ 1976 0 R ] >> endobj945 0 obj<< /Length 4781 >> stream
