n a TV monitor)111(. T)86(aking the above conditions into consideration, the )]TJT*[(brightness of the \337ash is 0x90 for a TV screen, and 0xC0 for a VGA monitor)111(.)]TJ/F18 1 Tf0 -2.7 TD(Recommended)Tj/F11 1 Tf0 -1.8 TD-0.002 Tw(If a persistent screen can be expected when a player takes no action for a long time, and especially if the )Tj0 -1.2 TD0 Tw(application display colors are not \336xed \(Example: web browser\), or if the above recommendations for )TjT*(white display are not \(or cannot\) be followed, prepare a screen saver and cause it to activate when a )TjT*(player takes no action for 300 seconds.)Tj0 -1.8 TD(It is up to the application whether the screen saver is an \322After Dark\323 type or simply a reduction in )Tj0 -1.2 TD(screen brightness.)Tj0 -1.8 TD-0.036 Tw(The same procedure should be followed during Pause time, so please refer to 12.3, )Tj/F12 1 Tf35.3303 0 TD(Screen Saver Function )Tj-35.3303 -1.2 TD0 Tw(During Pause)Tj/F11 1 Tf5.8887 0 TD( as well.)TjETendstreamendobj1030 0 obj<< /ProcSet [ /PDF /Text ] /Font << /F1 619 0 R /F11 441 0 R /F12 746 0 R /F18 731 0 R >> /ExtGState << /GS3 616 0 R >> >> endobj1031 0 obj<< /Type /Page /Parent 1056 0 R /Resources 1033 0 R /Contents 1032 0 R /CropBox [ 36 72 576 720 ] /B [ 1945 0 R ] >> endobj1032 0 obj<< /Length 1770 >> stream
